          "preset": "max_width_1440",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Mar 30 2020 21:02:00 GMT+0000",
          "alt": "Optimize Efficiency",
          "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/communications/systems/isuite-experience/procare-services/OptimizeEfficiency-PROCARE.jpg",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Oct 07 2024 16:03:11 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
          "enableBorder": "false"
        },
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-5891a4f69d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5891a4f69d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Mar 30 2020 18:37:34 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">Optimize efficiency</span></span></span></p>\n<p><b>85% of customers agree that ProCare has helped reduce intraoperative downtime.<sup>1</sup></b></p>\n<p>Procare service contracts help increase efficiency by minimizing paperwork and reducing downtime before service begins.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Priority response on all repairs</li>\n<li>Unlimited service calls and repairs</li>\n<li>Replacement parts and shipping</li>\n<li>Technician labor and travel</li>\n<li>Software fixes and upgrades</li>\n<li>24/7 technical phone support</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Apr 24 2020 18:46:49 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "standaloneimage": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-5891a4f69d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-65eab19e7c@example.invalid",
          "preset": "max_width_1440",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Mar 30 2020 21:02:11 GMT+0000",
          "alt": "Maximize Value",
          "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/communications/systems/isuite-experience/procare-services/MaximizeValue-PROCARE.jpg",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Oct 07 2024 16:03:36 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
          "enableBorder": "false"
        },
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-5891a4f69d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5891a4f69d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Mar 30 2020 18:37:34 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">Maximize value</span></span></span></p>\n<p><b>72% of ProCare customers agree they operate more efficiently and their costs have been reduced.<sup>2</sup></b></p>\n<p>Standardize costs and eliminate the guesswork. With a ProCare Service contract, you will know the cost of owning your equipment for the life of the contract. Contracts can range from 1-6 years and payment can be scheduled on a recurring basis.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Apr 24 2020 16:01:58 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
