          "preset": "max_width_1440",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Mar 30 2020 21:02:14 GMT+0000",
          "alt": "Consistent Performance",
          "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/communications/systems/isuite-experience/procare-services/ConsistentPerformance-PROCARE.jpg",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Oct 07 2024 16:04:07 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
          "enableBorder": "false"
        },
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-5891a4f69d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5891a4f69d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Mar 30 2020 18:37:34 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">Consistent performance</span></span></span></p>\n<p><b>90% of ProCare Services customers surveyed agreed that the life of their equupment has been extended.<sup>3</sup></b></p>\n<p>A Prevent service contract offers a comprehensive preventative maintenance program that includes annual equipment inspection and detailed reports to support regulatory requirements.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Annual inspection and repair on covered equipment</li>\n<li>Detailed report on inspection findings</li>\n<li>One seat at BioMed training</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Apr 24 2020 16:05:01 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
