    "disclaimer": "<p>References</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>In the 2014 Gallup CE11 Survey, a survey of 527 Stryker ProCare customers, 85% of Endoscopy Top Tier customers agreed that ProCare has helped reduce downtime.</li>\r\n<li>In the 2014 Gallup CE11 Survey, a survey of 527 Stryker ProCare customers, 72% of Endoscopy Top Tier customers indicated that they operate more efficiently and costs have been reduced.</li>\r\n<li>In the 2014 Gallup CE11 Survey, a survey of 527 Stryker ProCare customers, 90% of Endoscopy Top Tier customers indicated that the life of their equipment has been extended with ProCare Services,”</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n",
